Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.42,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(461.333,72.667)}Make it in Time, Nobita! The Robot Court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.50,Title,,0,0,0,,All done at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0} totally forgot to water the plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've to write my observation notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be hard on you, Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita relies on you too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,IS it my imagination or have you actually became little slimmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon, lend me that gadget!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it out fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say welcome home? Have you forget the aesthetics, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me the Substitute Bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.14,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna use it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot and left my Schoolbag at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbeliveable, you forgot your school bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.66,0:01:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.14,0:01:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0}, you don't have to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Doraemon, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so like you, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Time Cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.14,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me clean up the mess, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.26,0:02:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling wel-...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay, will be back in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll contact Dorami, just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, what's up, Bro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, you called me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro! Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he isn't waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've to call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I had lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro is feeling sick, so he's being treated at 22nd century robot hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...also don't forget to do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:03:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorameon is sick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon must have over ate Dorayaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's a glutton, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Nobi Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, but who're you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot Cops from the 22nd Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be put arrested under the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna arrest me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct, your friend Doraemon was hospitalised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to submit yourself at the 22nd Century Robot Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At the court?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna! Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be some kind of a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}! Sewashi-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, this must be some kind of a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your attorney general, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro is just over-exhausted a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,During our time at court...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mini-Dora will keep us updated with Bro's health.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The trial will begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:10.54,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328,374.6)}Chief Justice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:12.54,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.4,401.8)}Defendant
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:14.34,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:16.34,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Robot Trials shall begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
